 "name": "Romanian distance toll (TollRo)",
 "law": "Legea nr. 226/2023: TollRo is the unit rate times the km driven on the SETRE România network. Unit rates in lei/km including 21% VAT from Ordinul MTI nr. 1.925/2025 (Monitorul Oficial nr. 940/2025) as replaced by Ordinul MTI nr. 959/2026 of 8 October 2026: by maximum authorised mass (I over 3.5 to 7.5 t, II over 7.5 to under 12 t, III 12 t and over), road category (motorways and expressways, or national roads) and EURO class, with electric trucks at 25% of the EURO VI rate. One rate including the infrastructure and air-pollution parts. Rates here exclude VAT (divided by 1.21). Updated each 1 January by consumer prices.",
